            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Diane Fisher"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow! This is the BEST stew ever!! I only had to make a couple of substitutions because of what I had on hand: added 3 small parsnips, less carrots, regular vinegar and red wine (combined to make the amount of Red wine Vinegar called for). Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2009-11-03T13:53:10.737Z"
